# W28, a (k5): at home when its story is reset (150 s), then hosts b in stag0101 when staff restore it (300 s): the
# relay's keeper reloads, the hosted instance ends, nothing of the old story is saved again.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@170
log a at home after the reset
idle until epoch>=@200
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@420
log a home after the restore
